    <shape width="817.58" height="32" topLeftX="62.42" topLeftY="372" type="text" id="bPK">
      <content paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="12" paddingRight="7.2" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2" textAlign="left" autoFit="shape-auto-fit">
        <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体">本页判断：同一段代码出现第二次就切函数；名字说明作用，参数给全，返回值接住。</span></p>
      </content>
